  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "findings",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 330,
   "width": 1600,
   "height": 130,
   "text": "1  TWO front doors, neither complete — \"/\" links only to CSWeb + help (not the dashboard, map, data room or a single guide); help.html is the real hub but omits the data room, the codebook and pretest-guide.\n2  ORPHAN + DEAD ENDS — nothing links to pretest-guide.html (and it is time-boxed to 15 Jul 2026, now past); map.html links only to the dashboard, never back to the hub or home.\n3  THE DATA ROOM IS NEARLY INVISIBLE — one inbound link in the whole site (from the dashboard I fixed yesterday), yet it holds every export, the codebooks and the CSPro app packages.\n4  NO PROJECT LAYER — every title says \"UHC Survey Year 2\"; a second project has nowhere to live, and \"csweb\" names the SERVER, not what visitors came for.\n5  DUPLICATION + DRIFT RISK — F2 documented in 3 places (hcw-guide, f2-crosswalk 0.7k w, PWA site); crosswalks last touched 1 Jul while instruments shipped to v1.1.4/1.1.5/1.4.4 on 19 Jul.",
   "originalText": "1  TWO front doors, neither complete — \"/\" links only to CSWeb + help (not the dashboard, map, data room or a single guide); help.html is the real hub but omits the data room, the codebook and pretest-guide.\n2  ORPHAN + DEAD ENDS — nothing links to pretest-guide.html (and it is time-boxed to 15 Jul 2026, now past); map.html links only to the dashboard, never back to the hub or home.\n3  THE DATA ROOM IS NEARLY INVISIBLE — one inbound link in the whole site (from the dashboard I fixed yesterday), yet it holds every export, the codebooks and the CSPro app packages.\n4  NO PROJECT LAYER — every title says \"UHC Survey Year 2\"; a second project has nowhere to live, and \"csweb\" names the SERVER, not what visitors came for.\n5  DUPLICATION + DRIFT RISK — F2 documented in 3 places (hcw-guide, f2-crosswalk 0.7k w, PWA site); crosswalks last touched 1 Jul while instruments shipped to v1.1.4/1.1.5/1.4.4 on 19 Jul.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#7f1d1d",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
