  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "a_tree",
   "x": 76,
   "y": 652,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 270,
   "text": "capi.asiansocial.org/\n│\n├── /                    CAPI at ASPSI + project cards\n├── /projects/\n│   └── /uhc-y2/         ← ONE project = one namespace\n│       ├── overview     scope · instruments · status\n│       ├── guides/      enumerator · supervisor · HCW\n│       ├── instruments/ F1 F3 F4 F2 — one page each:\n│       │                crosswalk · codebook · dict ·\n│       │                CSPro package · versions\n│       ├── monitoring/  dashboard · map        🔒\n│       ├── data/        exports · data room    🔒\n│       └── manual/      full CAPI manual\n├── /about/              who ASPSI is · contact\n└── /platform/           how we build CAPI (shared)\n\nProject #2 = copy the namespace. Nothing collides.",
