   "width": 500,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "✓ self-contained: auth, branding, retirement\n   all handled per project\n✓ URL says which project you're in\n✓ how survey archives publish studies\n   (NADA/PSADA, DHS)\n○ generic CSEntry how-tos may repeat\n○ deeper URLs",
