  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "b_tree",
   "x": 621,
   "y": 652,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 270,
   "text": "capi.asiansocial.org/\n│\n├── /                 what ASPSI CAPI does\n├── /guides/         ALL guides, filter by project\n│      enumerator · supervisor · HCW · pretest\n├── /instruments/    ALL instruments, tagged\n│      [UHC-Y2] F1 F3 F4 F2 · [next] …\n├── /monitoring/     ALL dashboards          🔒\n├── /data/           ALL exports + codebooks 🔒\n├── /manual/         the CAPI manual\n└── /projects/       index page only (a list)\n\nOne section per JOB; the project is a label\ninside it, not a folder.",
   "originalText": "capi.asiansocial.org/\n│\n├── /                 what ASPSI CAPI does\n├── /guides/         ALL guides, filter by project\n│      enumerator · supervisor · HCW · pretest\n├── /instruments/    ALL instruments, tagged\n│      [UHC-Y2] F1 F3 F4 F2 · [next] …\n├── /monitoring/     ALL dashboards          🔒\n├── /data/           ALL exports + codebooks 🔒\n├── /manual/         the CAPI manual\n└── /projects/       index page only (a list)\n\nOne section per JOB; the project is a label\ninside it, not a folder.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
