  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "b_pros",
   "x": 615,
   "y": 946,
   "width": 500,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "✓ shortest URLs; generic content written once\n✓ repeat visitors go straight to \"data\"\n✗ access control messy — one /data/ mixing\n   different clients' gated files\n✗ sections become filtered lists;\n   \"which project is this?\" fades\n✗ retiring a project means combing everywhere",
   "originalText": "✓ shortest URLs; generic content written once\n✓ repeat visitors go straight to \"data\"\n✗ access control messy — one /data/ mixing\n   different clients' gated files\n✗ sections become filtered lists;\n   \"which project is this?\" fades\n✗ retiring a project means combing everywhere",
