  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "c_tree",
   "x": 1166,
   "y": 652,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 270,
   "text": "capi.asiansocial.org/\n│\n├── /                  \"I am a…\" 4 big doors\n├── /field/            enumerators + supervisors\n│      guide · tablet · sync · troubleshooting\n├── /respondents/      HCW: how to answer      (public)\n├── /managers/         dashboard · map · progress 🔒\n├── /analysts/         data · codebook · dicts   🔒\n└── /projects/uhc-y2/  the project record\n\nRole picks the door; project chosen inside.\n\n⚠ people wear several hats (Carl is all four),\nand roles blur across projects.",
   "originalText": "capi.asiansocial.org/\n│\n├── /                  \"I am a…\" 4 big doors\n├── /field/            enumerators + supervisors\n│      guide · tablet · sync · troubleshooting\n├── /respondents/      HCW: how to answer      (public)\n├── /managers/         dashboard · map · progress 🔒\n├── /analysts/         data · codebook · dicts   🔒\n└── /projects/uhc-y2/  the project record\n\nRole picks the door; project chosen inside.\n\n⚠ people wear several hats (Carl is all four),\nand roles blur across projects.",
