  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "c_pros",
   "x": 1160,
   "y": 946,
   "width": 500,
   "height": 90,
   "text": "✓ kindest first visit — you know where to click\n✓ maps onto who may see what (public/gated)\n✗ a doc serving two roles gets duplicated\n✗ project #2 forces a role×project matrix\n→ keep the IDEA, not the tree: role labels\n   on the project home page",
   "originalText": "✓ kindest first visit — you know where to click\n✓ maps onto who may see what (public/gated)\n✗ a doc serving two roles gets duplicated\n✗ project #2 forces a role×project matrix\n→ keep the IDEA, not the tree: role labels\n   on the project home page",
