  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "reco_t",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 1150,
   "width": 1560,
   "height": 68,
   "text": "RECOMMEND A, with C's welcome mat. Project-first tree (survives project #2, keeps each client's gated data separate), but the UHC-Y2 home opens with four role rows —\n\"I'm collecting in the field / I'm a healthcare worker / I'm supervising fieldwork / I'm using the data\" — so nobody has to understand the tree to get where they're going.\nRoot stays a thin catalog until project #2 exists. csweb.asiansocial.org keeps serving /csweb/ (tablets) and 301-redirects its doc pages to capi.",
   "originalText": "RECOMMEND A, with C's welcome mat. Project-first tree (survives project #2, keeps each client's gated data separate), but the UHC-Y2 home opens with four role rows —\n\"I'm collecting in the field / I'm a healthcare worker / I'm supervising fieldwork / I'm using the data\" — so nobody has to understand the tree to get where they're going.\nRoot stays a thin catalog until project #2 exists. csweb.asiansocial.org keeps serving /csweb/ (tablets) and 301-redirects its doc pages to capi.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
